&_nc_oc=AdrNkvcSdiLJ9W1bqm1WkbfyIZ2YrY7dnpacvwX_CAtchcihDi8DNQqQr88Nrte5O7w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8QIzMo1a3DghFbxiXAEr86HkyZ00Rqr7_BQUpPQledNg&oe=6A37F13D"}, {"file_name": "fwa3.png", "id": "1181628443981656", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821178_1181628447314989_4274608194453586051_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LLIK2xuDIvoQ7kNvwFyVR_Q&_nc_oc=AdqCX5_cMEoiSX3e6dx5RIci6wbVkRSbE_7KR-zx7ygx2y8qQ6ipAG_PbCMKK8L8lho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-f422YEuPIpvD8vdPFSlOVePeXWgoQFLn7UF_6XPbqCg&oe=6A37EF64"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail.png", "id": "1272221703934454", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305194_1272221707267787_1827965176633839495_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yFUkgXiEfPwQ7kNvwFrdaRB&_nc_oc=AdpgYGuttfbEXBk7Y485iknNH0VA6g5g9lrWcI4YOgFH78DA4JLdUID5pkvQ_8JPNvo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-VndttuhEY6UBSplUWr26704ciD0ddKSqmSnzYgFONyw&oe=6A37EFF0"}, "display_name": "Lasertag", "keywords": ["pvp", "fps", "laser", "tag"], "long_description": "# Live environment scanning with no prior setup!\nQuest 3 and 3S automatically scan your environment as you play. Virtual bullets collide with real walls and furniture.\n\n# Automatic connection\nNearby players connect automatically, so starting a match is super easy.\n\n# StrikerVR blaster support\nLasertag is compatible with the StrikerVR Mavrik haptic blaster peripheral to take your laser battle experiences to the next level! Pick one up at https://strikervr.com\n\n# Early access\nThis is more of a tech-demo than a full game at the moment, but we're actively working on making the game more engaging with fleshed-out gamemodes and more weapons.\n\n# Discord\nWe have a Discord server if you have questions, issues, ideas, etc. http://discord.gg/DgTqG5A6BD", "short_descri